Z||000005||Jncomutt||11-03-2001||03:57 PM||||I am using a similar type box.  It fits in the pass. foot well but fill it up the full length across.  I have one 10" Rockford Fosgate HX2 powered by a 600watt amp and it shakes the car beyond need.  If you run the full wattage to it, you'd better be a 'basshead'||||reg||1
